/**
 * ============================================================================
 * CEE MOCK PORTAL — ALL-IN-ONE (schema v3)
 * MBBS/BDS entrance mock-test practice system (MECEE-BL 2026 pattern)
 * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * DEPLOYMENT
 *   1. Create (or open) a Google Sheet — this script stores all data there.
 *      (Bind the web app to that sheet; SHEET_ID below stays '' for a
 *      container-attached script.)
 *   2. Extensions -> Apps Script, delete default code, paste THIS whole file.
 *   3. Save, then Deploy -> New deployment -> type "Web app":
 *        Execute as: Me        Who has access: Anyone
 *   4. Open the web app URL. The Users / Questions / Attempts / Responses /
 *      Messages / DailyExams tabs are created automatically (the question
 *      bank seeds itself with 10 demo questions if empty). Teacher account:
 *      register, then promote yourself by changing Role cell "student" ->
 *      "teacher" in the Users tab (first teacher bootstrap) — or edit the
 *      row directly.
 *
 * WHAT'S INSIDE (schema v3)
 *   - doGet() serving the embedded single-page frontend (base64 EMBEDDED_HTML)
 *   - Google Sheets data layer (6 tabs incl. Messages + DailyExams,
 *     LockService-serialized) with a versioned self-healing migration
 *     (CEE_TABS_READY='v3': missing columns are added, DailyExams is created,
 *     the question Difficulty column is backfilled to 'medium')
 *   - MECEE-BL 2026 blueprint: Zoology 40 / Botany 40 / Chemistry 50 /
 *     Physics 50 / MAT 20 (200 MCQs, +1 / −0.25 / 0, 54 s per question);
 *     legacy Biology/Maths sections are remapped on read
 *   - Difficulty-aware paper assembly (~20% easy / 60% medium / 20% hard)
 *   - MODEL EXAM OF THE DAY: one fixed paper per date, identical order for
 *     every student, one attempt each, daily leaderboard + rank, 7-day
 *     history, optional autopilot via a time-driven trigger (20:00)
 *   - SHA-256 password hashing, 24h sessions, one-device lock, login rate
 *     limit (5 fails -> 2-minute lockout) via CacheService
 *   - Deterministic seeded exam engine: server-side scoring, mock + custom
 *     practice + model-daily modes, instant-feedback practice, idempotent
 *     submission, late/auto-submit detection, bank-drift text-match fallback,
 *     authoritative exam metadata stored server-side (CEE_EXAM_META_<userId>)
 *   - Student analytics + leaderboard, teacher class analytics + CSV export,
 *     per-student drill-down, MailApp messaging (quota-aware),
 *     in-app student→teacher messaging with teacher inbox, printable
 *     per-attempt teacher reports
 *   - Question bank CRUD with duplicate protection, difficulty tags and
 *     live-model-exam question locking (MODEL_QUESTION_LOCKED) + bulk upload
 *     with server-side dry-run preview + PDF helper
 *   - Official MECEE-BL 2026 syllabus browser (inside the embedded frontend)
 *   - SHEET ADMIN CONSOLE: "CEE Portal" menu when the spreadsheet opens
 *     (approve registrations, register a student, generate the model exam,
 *     autopilot), a live Dashboard tab, dropdowns + colour coding, and an
 *     optional edit watcher that emails students when you edit their Status
 *   - MailApp emails: registration, approval/rejection, results, password
 *
 * NOTE: functions ending with "_" are private (not callable via
 * google.script.run). The public surface is the documented API
 * (doGet, registerUser, loginUser, logoutUser, …, bulkUploadQuestions,
 * generateDailyExam, getDailyExamStatus, startDailyExam, getDailyLeaderboard,
 * setDailyAutopilot, autoGenerateDailyExam, initializeSheet, getSpreadsheet)
 * plus the two brief-required utilities hashPassword() and shuffleArray().
 * ============================================================================
 */

